  "notes": "{超|こ}える means to exceed, surpass, or go beyond a limit.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Takes を particle for what is exceeded\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {超|こ}える: to exceed, surpass (abstract limits)\n- {越|こ}える: to cross over, pass (physical boundaries)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {予算|よさん}を{超|こ}える: to exceed the budget\n- {限界|げんかい}を{超|こ}える: to exceed limits\n- {想像|そうぞう}を{超|こ}える: beyond imagination\n- 〜を{超|こ}えた: beyond ~, transcending ~\n\nRELATED:\n{超|ちょう}〜 is a prefix meaning \"super\" or \"ultra\" (e.g., {超|ちょう}{高速|こうそく} = ultra-high-speed)",
